{"name": "VELATO", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VELATO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A roguelike tactical card battler combining poker-hand mechanics with deep relational synergy builds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In VELATO, you sit across the table from the system Bosses that watch how you play, remembers when you've bluffed, and decides whether to call you out. Every hand becomes two games at once: the hand you build, and the mind game you play to sell it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Does the bluff go through or will the Bosses call it out? Do you dare to bluff? \ud83e\udd21</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Velato Poker-Bluff Roguelike Deckbuilder\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/985741c1ad61e7d5684880826027c5cf.poster.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/985741c1ad61e7d5684880826027c5cf.webm?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/985741c1ad61e7d5684880826027c5cf.mp4?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is the Game like?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Velato has 3 play modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single mode - Single-player vs Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Mode - Player vs Player (On the Roadmap)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell Mode - Multiplayer (On the Roadmap)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras_big/1887fc2a7138456b458e6cd19c2b3a6e.webp?t=1787027263\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/1887fc2a7138456b458e6cd19c2b3a6e.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will climb through <strong>endless floors</strong>, and each floor puts you through three escalating tables.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Small table \u2014 warm up and set your strategy with 50 Golds per table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras_big/2ad06e2096ad228b2a448b38a9ac48cc.webp?t=1787027263\" height=\"1015\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ad06e2096ad228b2a448b38a9ac48cc.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Big table \u2014 pressure rises, stakes climb from 50 to 70 Golds and more per Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras_big/4c3a5a2a2b440236e3f0b501f1d78e0a.webp?t=1787027263\" height=\"1015\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/4c3a5a2a2b440236e3f0b501f1d78e0a.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What are the specials?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bluff against 24 Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's Card Battler. It's Roguelike and you need to build your deck carefully. Pick up the best hand to bluff and challenge the Bosses to survive and play on next tables.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Bluff Roguelike Deckbuilder\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ea2458b14228cc303ec554fa2fa6a6d.poster.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ea2458b14228cc303ec554fa2fa6a6d.webm?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ea2458b14228cc303ec554fa2fa6a6d.mp4?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>124 Jokers to help you survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can buy Joker after beating a boss in Velato Store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/7de655eb1d074e4d223a3e91d8014d26.poster.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/7de655eb1d074e4d223a3e91d8014d26.webm?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/7de655eb1d074e4d223a3e91d8014d26.mp4?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read and calculate carefully before you buy any Jokers. If not, you will not gain any scores in the next table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/acbc0dd56be02b5d04dd83149f15092c.poster.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/acbc0dd56be02b5d04dd83149f15092c.webm?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/acbc0dd56be02b5d04dd83149f15092c.mp4?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>24 bosses in Velato</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you can survive, you meet different boss in each new table. Each boss will have their own power to defend your hand and you need to remember all their faces to build the most appropriate deck to beat them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras_big/b8c1202620afa6ea1a43c96de61c2cd2.webp?t=1787027263\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/b8c1202620afa6ea1a43c96de61c2cd2.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bluff is The heart of the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bluff system is the thing we're most proud of. That tension of staring down an opponent and daring them to call you \u2014 the kind that normally only exists in multiplayer poker \u2014 now lives inside a roguelike card battler. It turns every hand from play for fun to play and calculate to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose \"Challenge\" or \"Skip\" button if you're confident with your Jokers' power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Bluff Roguelike Deckbuilder\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ea2458b14228cc303ec554fa2fa6a6d.poster.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ea2458b14228cc303ec554fa2fa6a6d.webm?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/2ea2458b14228cc303ec554fa2fa6a6d.mp4?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Betting Golds is another strategy in Bluffing stage. If you're ready to all-in, maximize the gold. If not, keep your gold to play next tables.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/86d637d0c74165204f89577f69ae3f6f.poster.avif?t=1787027263\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/86d637d0c74165204f89577f69ae3f6f.webm?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/extras/86d637d0c74165204f89577f69ae3f6f.mp4?t=1787027263\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "VELATO is A roguelike tactical card battler combining poker-hand mechanics with deep relational synergy builds and an adaptive bluffing system where opponents remember how you play.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542750/13e28da3c07530806bf10fc4055c3882c0bc71ce/header.jpg?t=1787027263", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Card Battler", "Perma Death", "Trading Card Game", "Poker", "PvE"], "developers": "VELATO", "publishers": "VELATO", "release_date": "Jul 5, 2026", "price": "$8.99", "appid": "4542750", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "21 April 2026 - Request Access\n\n2 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tasozs-uajE", "first_seen": 1776729600.0, "review_rank": 807}